# 💰 Finance Marketing Agent
‎
‎An AI-powered marketing agent that generates professional TikTok and Facebook posts for your finance digital products.
‎
‎## 🚀 Quick Start
‎
‎1. Clone: `git clone https://github.com/michaeldubois996-ship-it/finance-marketing-agent.git`
‎2. Install: `pip install -r requirements.txt`
‎3. Setup: `cp .env.example .env` and add your OpenAI API key
‎4. Run: `python main.py`
‎
‎## 📱 Features
‎
‎✅ AI-powered post generation (GPT-4)
‎✅ TikTok & Facebook optimized
‎✅ 15+ pre-built finance topics
‎✅ Professional, educational tone
‎✅ Batch generation (1-20 posts)
‎✅ Interactive CLI
‎
